      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Casa Navarro, a restored 19th‑century home in San Antonio’s heart, once belonged to one of Texas’ most influential early leaders.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
